When ACL is used addmm_impl_cpu_ on ARM may call mkldnn_matmul which materialize the CoW tensors.
Affects:
python test/test_ops.py TestCompositeComplianceCPU.test_cow_input_addmm_cpu_float32
python test/test_ops.py TestCompositeComplianceCPU.test_cow_input_addmm_decomposed_cpu_float32
python test/test_ops.py TestCompositeComplianceCPU.test_cow_input___rmatmul___cpu_float32
python test/test_ops.py TestCompositeComplianceCPU.test_cow_input_cholesky_inverse_cpu_float32
python test/test_ops.py TestCompositeComplianceCPU.test_cow_input_cholesky_solve_cpu_float32

See https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/197435#issuecomment-5772846715

Author: Alexander Grund (TU Dresden)
